        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Experience one of the world's last truly wild landscapes — vast steppes, dramatic deserts, and pristine mountains.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="group">
        <span class="text-5xl font-bold text-[#C9A24D]">02</span>
